    },
    {
      "id": "intro_4",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Why, you may wonder, should spiders be our friends?",
      "translation": "你可能会问，为什么蜘蛛应该是我们的朋友？",
      "startTime": 14.83,
      "endTime": 19.14,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Wonder",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "纳闷，想知道"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Because they destroy so many insects, and insects include some of the greatest enemies of the human race.",
      "translation": "因为它们消灭了那么多昆虫，而昆虫包括人类的一些最大敌人。",
      "startTime": 19.15,
      "endTime": 26.73,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Destroy",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "消灭，毁坏"
          },
          {
            "word": "Human race",
            "pos": "n.",
            "meaning": "人类"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Insects would make it impossible for us to live in the world;",
      "translation": "昆虫会使我们无法在世界上生存；",
      "startTime": 26.74,
      "endTime": 30.37,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Impossible",
            "pos": "adj.",
            "meaning": "不可能的"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "they would devour all our crops and kill our flocks and herds,",
      "translation": "它们会吞噬我们所有的作物，杀死我们的羊群和牛群，",
      "startTime": 30.38,
      "endTime": 34.61,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
            "word": "Devour",
            "pos": "v.",
            "meaning": "吞噬"
          },
